                 es.add(new Edge(i, n - 1 - j, 1, i == j ? 0 : a[i]));\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        long ans = 0;\n        for (int x : a) ans += x;\n        System.out.println(ans - solveMinCostFlow(compileWD(sink + 1, es), src, sink, n));\n    }\n\n    static class Edge {\n        int from, to, capacity, cost, flow;\n        Edge complement;\n        Edge(int from, int to, int capacity, int cost) {\n            this.from = from; this.to = to; this.capacity = capacity; this.cost = cost;\n        }\n    }\n\n    static Edge[][] compileWD(int n, List<Edge> edges) {\n        Edge[][] g = new Edge[n][];\n        for (int i = edges.size() - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n            Edge origin = edges.get(i);\n            Edge clone = new Edge(origin.to, origin.from, origin.capacity, -origin.cost);\n            clone.flow = origin.capacity;\n            clone.complement = origin;\n            origin.complement = clone;\n            edges.add(clone);\n        }\n        int[] p = new int[n];\n        for (Edge e : edges) p[e.from]++;\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) g[i] = new Edge[p[i]];\n        for (Edge e : edges) g[e.from][--p[e.from]] = e;\n        return g;\n    }\n\n    static long solveMinCostFlow(Edge[][] g, int source, int sink, long all) {\n        int n = g.length;\n        long mincost = 0;\n        int[] potential = new int[n];\n        int[] d = new int[n];\n        Edge[] inedge = new Edge[n];\n        while (all > 0) {\n            Arrays.fill(d, Integer.MAX_VALUE / 2);\n            Arrays.fill(inedge, null);\n            d[source] = 0;\n            boolean[] used = new boolean[n];\n            for (int iter = 0; iter < n; iter++) {\n                int u = -1;\n                int best = Integer.MAX_VALUE / 2;\n                for (int v = 0; v < n; v++) {\n                    if (!used[v] && d[v] < best) {\n                        best = d[v];\n                        u = v;\n                    }\n                }\n                if (u == -1) break;\n                used[u] = true;\n                for (Edge e : g[u]) {\n                    if (e.capacity - e.flow > 0) {\n                        int nd = d[u] + e.cost + potential[u] - potential[e.to];\n                        if (d[e.to] > nd) {\n                            d[e.to] = nd;\n                            inedge[e.to] = e;\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            if (inedge[sink] == null) break;\n            long minflow = all;\n            long sumcost = 0;\n            for (Edge e = inedge[sink]; e != null; e = inedge[e.from]) {\n                if (e.capacity - e.flow < minflow) minflow = e.capacity - e.flow;\n                sumcost += e.cost;\n            }\n            mincost += minflow * sumcost;\n            for (Edge e = inedge[sink]; e != null; e = inedge[e.from]) {\n                e.flow += minflow;\n                e.complement.flow -= minflow;\n            }\n            all -= minflow;\n            for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n                potential[i] += d[i];\n            }\n        }\n        return mincost;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        new F().solve();\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport sys\nimport heapq\n\nclass Edge:\n    def __init__(self, from_node, to_node, capacity, cost):\n        self.from_node = from_node\n        self.to_node = to_node\n        self.capacity = capacity\n        self.cost = cost\n        self.flow = 0\n        self.complement = None\n\ndef compileWD(n, edges):\n    # Add reverse edges\n    original_edges = list(edges)\n    for e in original_edges:\n        rev = Edge(e.to_node, e.from_node, e.capacity, -e.cost)\n        rev.flow = e.capacity\n        rev.complement = e\n        e.complement = rev\n        edges.append(rev)\n    # Build adjacency list\n    g = [[] for _ in range(n)]\n    for e in edges:\n        g[e.from_node].append(e)\n    return g\n\ndef solveMinCostFlow(g, source, sink, all_flow):\n    n = len(g)\n    mincost = 0\n    potential = [0] * n\n    INF = 10**18\n    while all_flow > 0:\n        dist = [INF] * n\n        inedge = [None] * n\n        dist[source] = 0\n        pq = [(0, source)]\n        while pq:\n            d, u = heapq.heappop(pq)\n            if dist[u] < d:\n                continue\n            for e in g[u]:\n                if e.capacity - e.flow > 0:\n                    nd = d + e.cost + potential[u] - potential[e.to_node]\n                    if dist[e.to_node] > nd:\n                        dist[e.to_node] = nd\n                        inedge[e.to_node] = e\n                        heapq.heappush(pq, (nd, e.to_node))\n        if inedge[sink] is None:\n            break\n        # Find min flow along path\n        minflow = all_flow\n        sumcost = 0\n        e = inedge[sink]\n        while e is not None:\n            minflow = min(minflow, e.capacity - e.flow)\n            sumcost += e.cost\n            e = inedge[e.from_node]\n        mincost += minflow * sumcost\n        # Update flow\n        e = inedge[sink]\n        while e is not None:\n            e.flow += minflow\n            e.complement.flow -= minflow\n            e = inedge[e.from_node]\n        all_flow -= minflow\n        # Update potentials\n        for i in range(n):\n            if dist[i] < INF:\n                potential[i] += dist[i]\n    return mincost\n\ndef solve():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    it = iter(data)\n    n = int(next(it))\n    s = list(next(it))\n    a = [int(next(it)) for _ in range(n)]\n\n    # Check frequency\n    freq = [0] * 26\n    for ch in s:\n        freq[ord(ch) - ord('a')] += 1\n    for f in freq:\n        if f > n // 2:\n            print(-1)\n            return\n\n    # Initial swap to ensure a[i] <= a[n-1-i]\n    for i in range(n // 2):\n        if a[i] > a[n - 1 - i]:\n            a[i], a[n - 1 - i] = a[n - 1 - i], a[i]\n            s[i], s[n - 1 - i] = s[n - 1 - i], s[i]\n\n    # Build edges\n    es = []\n    src = n\n    sink = n + 1\n    for i in range(n // 2):\n        es.append(Edge(src, i, 1, 0))\n        es.append(Edge(n - 1 - i, sink, 1, 0))\n        for j in range(n // 2):\n            if s[i] != s[n - 1 - j]:\n                cost = 0 if i == j else a[i]\n                es.append(Edge(i, n - 1 - j, 1, cost))\n\n    g = compileWD(n + 2, es)\n    total = sum(a)\n    mincost = solveMinCostFlow(g, src, sink, n)\n    print(total - mincost)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    solve()\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -8.5588610090781e-05, -0.0005644158809445798, -1.2993727978027891e-05, -0.029875265434384346, -0.00199083867482841, -0.0005884823040105402, -0.0009146321099251509, -0.0007387054502032697, -3.814689989667386e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.02324567921459675, -5.960462772236497e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -0.9693959951400757, -0.6962693929672241, -2.861018856492592e-06, 0.0, -0.31326207518577576, 0.0, -0.31326356530189514, -1.7881377516459906e-06, 0.0, -2.1815061700181104e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -0.00019977481861133128, -4.660974445869215e-05, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -4.768370445162873e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0019287331961095333, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -0.00015877417172305286, 0.0, -1.311301275563892e-06, -2.50339189733495e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -4.768370445162873e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -7.390948667307384e-06, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.0728830375228426e-06, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -0.0005009111482650042, -6.210611172718927e-05, -1.9073468138230965e-06, -0.12841321527957916, -0.00018618